 you have to figure out whether to kill the guy or not.<br /> <br /> If you're a Werewolf and want to do things other than claw things. What do you do?<br /> <br /> * Use Rites to cleanse areas with magic.<br /> * Go into the Umbra and slay the Bane of Pollution or whatnot so all of the oil damage or chemical waste dissolves in the real world (which I assume is what happens unless more is poured into the river)<br /> * Fight the supernatural goons that the baddies are sending against you. The WOD is a comic book so while Roxxon Oil can only be beaten by Tony Stark money or the government, that doesn't mean Roxxon isn't sending the Rhino to kill protestors.<br /> * Put a Glass Walker keyfob that will sort through all of the information in a hacking tool because MAGIC. Making hacking like it is in movies.<br /> And so on.<br /> <br /> Basically, SPIDER-MAN: MILES MORALES is a Werewolf: the Apocalypse game. Miles Morales and Phin both want to stop Roxxon Oil from putting up their toxic nuclear reactors in Harlem that will kill thousands of people over the next few years but they will continue to build because they make more money than they'll pay out in wrongful deaths.<br /> <br /> Phin wants to blow up Roxxon's HQ and kill people but this just helps Roxxon look like heroes in the public eye. Miles Morales' mother works with the politics while Miles struggles to get the information they need to expose Roxxon in the public and fights the Rhino and otrher supervillains while sabotaging their work.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, this actually explains a lot. Because this just sounds like all the options you'd have to do in a Werewolf game before W5. In fact, you have a much easier time doing all of these things pre-W5 because you're not limited from the Umbra or doing things with large groups of Garou. And your other posts seem to imply that you think all the Garou do is just &quot;claw stuff.&quot; Do you think that normal Werewolf games are just about mindlessly swinging at whatever is closest to them because you played a hack-and-slash campaign at 14, or...?\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T06:26:59-08:00","id":1528908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gh0st-fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528907#post1528907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, this actually explains a lot. Because this just sounds like all the options you'd have to do in a Werewolf game before W5. In fact, you have a much easier time doing all of these things pre-W5 because you're not limited from the Umbra or doing things with large groups of Garou. And your other posts seem to imply that you think all the Garou do is just &quot;claw stuff.&quot; Do you think that normal Werewolf games are just about mindlessly swinging at whatever is closest to them because you played a hack-and-slash campaign at 14, or...?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is one of those things where I feel like I've said something and it got lost because I thought a big point I was establishing was &quot;None of this is new to the setting. Just an emphasizing.&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm mostly annoyed the Stargazers and Children of Gaia have been saying everything W5 said for decades but they act like no Garou had been saying this until recently.<br /> <br /> And the Stargazers are now GONE for some reason despite this being when they're most relevant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T06:29:14-08:00","id":1528909,"title":"","content":"That's the thing, though. You don't need to do a W5-level gutting of the entire system to accomplish this. You just have to use the full range of options that WtA already gave you. So why even bother with W5's doomerism and crappy mechanics?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T06:34:31-08:00","id":1528910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528904#post1528904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Weirdly, I have an actual response to this.<br /> <br /> &quot;What do werewolves have to save Gaia that humans don't?&quot;<br /> <br /> Answer: &quot;Superpowers.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>You say that, but then right after you go;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528904#post1528904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Garou can't beat the Wyrm with claws and attempting to do so has failed from probably the 20th century onward. Basically, once Pentex got involved, the Garou lost the war. At least with their current methodology. Its certainly FUN to go on a murder spree through Endron oil in EARTHBLOOD but I don't think anyone can argue that Cahill was making significant progress against Endron that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Rage, claws and such ARE the garou superpowers and they fuel their gifts and give them the ability to do what they do.<br /> <br /> Especially as you then basically state as much here;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528904#post1528904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Use Rites to cleanse areas with magic.<br /> * Go into the Umbra and slay the Bane of Pollution or whatnot so all of the oil damage or chemical waste dissolves in the real world (which I assume is what happens unless more is poured into the river)<br /> * Fight the supernatural goons that the baddies are sending against you. The WOD is a comic book so while Roxxon Oil can only be beaten by Tony Stark money or the government, that doesn't mean Roxxon isn't sending the Rhino to kill protestors.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is what the game in legacy was. That is what the claws, fangs and Rage are meant to do. You can beat the Wyrm by claws and fangs, because you are striking it in the spirit. You just ALSO do the other things, because you are a spirit warrior.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5},{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T06:35:51-08:00","id":1528911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528910#post1528910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is what the game in legacy was. That is what the claws, fangs and Rage are meant to do. You can beat the Wyrm by claws and fangs, because you are striking it in the spirit. You just ALSO do the other things, because you are a spirit warrior.</div> </div> </div> </div>So your argument is, &quot;You don't think the Garou failed because the Garou were always doing what they were supposed to do?&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T06:42:42-08:00","id":1528912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528911#post1528911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So your argument is, &quot;You don't think the Garou failed because the Garou were always doing what they were supposed to do?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I am saying; The garou failed because they spent the time they could have corralled the Wyrm fighting petty battles over pretty much nothing. While the Wyrm grew stronger. Had the garou done what you described above from the start? There would be no Apocalypse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4},{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T06:46:21-08:00","id":1528913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528912#post1528912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, I am saying; The garou failed because they spent the time they could have corralled the Wyrm fighting petty battles over pretty much nothing. While the Wyrm grew stronger. Had the garou done what you described above from the start? There would be no Apocalypse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thank you for explaining.<br /> <br /> For me, I do think there's one serious problem with W5 and that's the way the game describes the Garou SHOULD be fighting and which was always the way I enjoyed it most was one that involved heavy involvement of kinfolk and regular humans.<br /> <br /> Which are now gone.<br /> <br /> Even Earthblood seemed to be ignoring this as the Caern is making use of a lot of human environmentalists to help fight this and Cahil's daughter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T06:51:34-08:00","id":1528914,"title":"","content":"I agree on the Kinfolk part. People rag on the concept a lot, but that tie to humanity and proxy to reach into more mundane spheres while the Garou handle the more violent and spiritual aspects was an underrated but vital asset against the Wyrm. Getting rid of them just feels like one more way W5 kneecaps the Garou out of being effective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T07:03:35-08:00","id":1528916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528913#post1528913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, thank you for explaining.<br /> <br /> For me, I do think there's one serious problem with W5 and that's the way the game describes the Garou SHOULD be fighting and which was always the way I enjoyed it most was one that involved heavy involvement of kinfolk and regular humans.<br /> <br /> Which are now gone.<br /> <br /> Even Earthblood seemed to be ignoring this as the Caern is making use of a lot of human environmentalists to help fight this and Cahil's daughter.</div> </div> </div> </div>The lack of kinfolk AND how they structured Rage. You are right in that the human-like methods are the best ones in W5, because having Rage makes you basically a loose cannon in the worst ways. Not only because the Rage pool is too small but also how easy it is to gain it and how it affects EVERY roll.<br /> <br /> So, it is very much smart to lose the wolf if you want to do things how W5 wants them to be done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-19T07:08:04-08:00","id":1528919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528916#post1528916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The lack of kinfolk AND how they structured Rage. You are right in that the human-like methods are the best ones in W5, because having Rage makes you basically a loose cannon in the worst ways. Not only because the Rage pool is too small but also how easy it is to gain it and how it affects EVERY roll.<br /> <br /> So, it is very much smart to lose the wolf if you want to do things how W5 wants them to be done.</div> </div> </div> </div>100% agreed.<br /> <br /> Basically, they say that claws aren't the way but hamper your ability to do things non-claw-way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a h