/div> <div class=\"message\">I will respectfully withdraw from the conversation as I don't think your understanding me and I'm certainly not understanding you.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I was directing you to my article, &quot;Ten Tips to Running the Cult of Fenris&quot; which is in large part about expanding on their ideology, the tragedy of their fall, and who are the kind of Garou who are likely to join their organization as well as why.<br /> <br /> It is also the title of the thread.<br /> <br /> Isn't that exactly what you asked?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-20T04:33:04-08:00","id":1528990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528931#post1528931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The dog thing?</div> </div> </div> </div>To go into a bit more detail as to why it's bad:<br /> <br /> For Hispo it says &quot;It\u2019s \u201cThat\u2019s a really big dog\u201d-big, but not immediately visibly supernatural.&quot;. A couple issues: First, it's not &quot;visibly supernatural&quot; shouldn't be a thing because Hispo (along with Glabro and Crinos) is one of the so-called &quot;supernatural forms&quot;. The same way Glabro reveals its supernatural nature upon close inspection (you're hairier than in your Homid Form, the loping gait etc.). What's strikingly supernatural about the Hispo that it's a <i>really large</i> wolf. There's nothing normal about the size of that form. The other thing is of course the description of the size. It even starts with &quot;The hispo form resembles that of a huge, primordial wolf.\u200b&quot; A wolf but bigger is obviously quite large.<br /> <br /> For Lupus it says &quot;The lupus form is that of a regular-sized wolf. Indeed, it might easily be mistaken for a large dog in certain areas (particularly where wolves are infrequent visitors\u2026).\u200b&quot; It isn't just the wrong comparison to a dog, though. The other issue is that there's a specific Merit on pg 98 called Clement Lupus which says &quot;Your lupus form appears more dog-like than wolf-like, and unless they have a reason to believe so, no human onlooker who sees you in lupus form thinks that you\u2019re a wolf.\u200b&quot; So the Merit relies on the premise that people would not think the Lupus-form looks just like a big dog. Only after buying the Merit would people think that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-20T05:06:36-08:00","id":1528996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528990#post1528990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The other issue is that there's a specific Merit on pg 98 called Clement Lupus which says &quot;Your lupus form appears more <b>dog-like than wolf-like</b>, and unless they have a reason to believe so, no human onlooker who sees you in lupus form thinks that you\u2019re a wolf.&quot; So the Merit relies on the premise that people would not think the Lupus-form looks just like a big dog. Only after buying the Merit would people think that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay so, wow.<br /> <br /> We now <b>canonically</b> have low content wolfdog garou.<br /> <br /> If we go to rules lawyery levels with this, it can't look like a husky or a GSD since those get mistaken for wolves (yes really.) Your lupus (and crinos and hispo) forms are now a chocolate labrador XD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-20T05:10:02-08:00","id":1528997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528996#post1528996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay so, wow.<br /> <br /> We now <b>canonically</b> have low content wolfdog garou.<br /> <br /> If we go to rules lawyery levels with this, it can't look like a husky or a GSD since those get mistaken for wolves (yes really.) Your lupus (and crinos and hispo) forms are now a chocolate labrador XD</div> </div> </div> </div>Going to the ST and telling them that my Garou PC looks like a dachshund in Lupus Form thanks to this Merit <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-20T05:24:39-08:00","id":1529000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1528996#post1528996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay so, wow.<br /> <br /> We now <b>canonically</b> have low content wolfdog garou.<br /> <br /> If we go to rules lawyery levels with this, it can't look like a husky or a GSD since those get mistaken for wolves (yes really.) Your lupus (and crinos and hispo) forms are now a chocolate labrador XD</div> </div> </div> </div>EVERY SINGLE W5 AP I've seen/heard about has at least one character with Clement Lupus and the vast 