-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529378#post1529378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This, and if that story is true, it's hardly a fair comparison to the effect the LARP had on W5's development. Removing a group with a canon explanation as to why because it was causing recurring problems is a far cry from &quot;someone did something completely insane and unviable in a LARP years ago that they shouldn't have been able to do, so I'm going to punish the whole game for it by removing an entire massive element of Werewolf's identity&quot;<b> (hugely nerfing the Umbra because years ago someone sniped a Prince)</b></div> </div> </div> </div>I feel that's also because someone DMed badly.<br /> <br /> Because a Prince should be in a place where the Gauntlet is incredibly high and probably full of Banes.<br /> <br /> Also, any surprise advantage is no higher than a Kindred with Obfuscate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T19:21:31-08:00","id":1529384,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529381#post1529381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why are you telling me this?<br /> <br /> It's in the Ten Tips how much I think that is stupid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why are you telling me that somebody showed up at a LARP in the 90s wanting to play racist characters?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T20:19:21-08:00","id":1529394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529377#post1529377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fun fact:<br /> <br /> Thousands of people around the world played Get of Fenris characters who were explicitly not racist.<br /> <br /> Makes you wonder, though: Why is the W5-change giving the spotlight to the players who thought the Get of Fenris Tribe was an excuse to play racist PCs? Why is the answer to those kinds of assholes to create a whole faction that is all about what those people wanted the Fenrir to be like? If it were me, the change I would pursue would be to double down on getting further away from letting something like that happen rather than giving that idea an even bigger platform.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, as a new edition and a new setting, it would have been much easier to just say, &quot;Those racist Get don't exist and never existed,&quot; instead of bringing those racist Get into the new edition and then making the entire Tribe revolve around them. So the goal clearly wasn't to remove the racist element of the Get from the game, but rather to put it front and center.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T21:11:43-08:00","id":1529397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529384#post1529384\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why are you telling me that somebody showed up at a LARP in the 90s wanting to play racist characters?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because it's very much an example of how this left an impression on Karim.<br /> <br /> ?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529394#post1529394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, as a new edition and a new setting, it would have been much easier to just say, &quot;Those racist Get don't exist and never existed,&quot; instead of bringing those racist Get into the new edition and then making the entire Tribe revolve around them. So the goal clearly wasn't to remove the racist element of the Get from the game, but rather to put it front and center.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is what they ultimately decided on. The Cult falling for other reasons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 01-25-2024, 12:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-24T21:25:29-08:00","id":1529400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529397#post1529397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because it's very much an example of how this left an impression on Karim.<br /> <br /> ?</div> </div> </div> </div>But that's not what Damian May was referring to. It was about nerfing the Umbra because it was considered &quot;&quot;&quot;overpowered against vampires&quot;&quot;&quot;, according to behind-the-scenes details leaked by Sambrano.<br /> <br /> No, the reason Karim made the Get fall is because he saw that they were the Norse Mythology tribe, blacked out, and did everything in his power to turn W5 into his single-minded desire to let everyone know that all Norse people are Nazis without exception. The only reason it's not more explicit than it is is because a bunch of devs basically had to beg him to stop, and even then he kept throwing in hints towards it everywhere he could get away with it. Just because the book <i>somewhat</i> backed down from making it super-blatant doesn't mean these fingerprints aren't all over it.<br /> <br /> It's a problem because it's such a huge factor dragging down the entire game with it. You'd have to completely overhaul the Cult of Fenris to get rid of this baggage, and while your efforts to do so are admirable, I don't know if it's enough, and just burying it by saying &quot;but they're not<i> reeeally</i> racist tho&quot; isn't quite cutting it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Honestly, I think the best way to make what you've written work is to just bite the bullet and house rule that it's unrelated to the Get of Fenris directly, and is instead a group of Garou from all tribes that have decided to go full ecofascist in the face of Apocalypse, and do as you said and just ignore all the white supremacist implications all together. Change the name, even so the tie is completely cut. You did move towards this, but just going all the way with it would go a long way to removing the baggage, I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","user":"gh0st-fox","date":". 01-25-2024, 12:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T02:33:51-08:00","id":1529410,"title":"","content":"Just one question, how trustworthy is Sambrano?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T02:49:07-08:00","id":1529411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529410#post1529410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just one question, how trustworthy is Sambrano?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll admit, I don't agree with him on everything, and it would be one hell of a scandal if he was lying. But considering how what he's said/leaked has lined up very well with the finished project of W5 and he's posted actual notes from Karim backing up a good deal of the stuff he was confronted with, there's no reason to believe he's lying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","user":"gh0st-fox","date":". 01-25-2024, 06:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T03:04:58-08:00","id":1529412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529410#post1529410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just one question, how trustworthy is Sambrano?</div> </div> </div> </div>Extremely. Also, Paradox hasn't even tried to seriously deny it anyway. They've only tried to downplay it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T03:33:59-08:00","id":1529413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529410#post1529410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just one question, how trustworthy is Sambrano?</div> </div> </div> </div>He can dog sit for me anyday, and I don't say that about most of my family.<br /> <br /> And his statements have been corroborated privately by other W5 writers who can't say anything public without being blackballed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T07:02:25-08:00","id":1529423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529410#post1529410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just one question, how trustworthy is Sambrano?</div> </div> </div> </div>My interpretation is that there's an element that gets glossed over when discussing his article or actually several articles that should be kept in mind.<br /> <br /> 1. <b>Sambrano actually doesn't care about the Get</b>: When he speaks about it with Karim, he's talking about it as a fan. It's not related to his primary issues with the developers and just thought it was a bad idea. Karim really wanted to make a bunch of white supremacist villains to kill because he really fucking hates Nazis. That's not...a bad thing. Sambrano, again as a W:TA fan, just felt making the Get was a bad thing. He also confirms that everyone forced him not to do it.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>His primary complaint is about the decoupling of the Garou from individual cultural identity</b>: Which is something that was the entire theme of the game's re-imagining.<br /> <br /> 3. <b>His biggest complaint is lack of attribution</b>: Which is actually 100% accurate and he should be listed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T07:13:29-08:00","id":1529424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gh0st-fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529400#post1529400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But that's not what Damian May was referring to. It was about nerfing the Umbra because it was considered &quot;&quot;&quot;overpowered against vampires&quot;&quot;&quot;, according to behind-the-scenes details leaked by Sambrano.<br /> <br /> No, the reason Karim made the Get fall is because he saw that they were the Norse Mythology tribe, blacked out, and did everything in his power to turn W5 into his single-minded desire to let everyone know that all Norse people are Nazis without exception. The only reason it's not more explicit than it is is because a bunch of devs basically had to beg him to stop, and even then he kept throwing in hints towards it everywhere he could get away with it. Just because the book <i>somewhat</i> backed down from making it super-blatant doesn't mean these fingerprints aren't all over it.<br /> <br /> It's a problem because it's such a huge factor dragging down the entire game with it. You'd have to completely overhaul the Cult of Fenris to get rid of this baggage, and while your efforts to do so are admirable, I don't know if it's enough, and just burying it by saying &quot;but they're not<i> reeeally</i> racist tho&quot; isn't quite cutting it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Honestly, I think the best way to make what you've written work is to just bite the bullet and house rule that it's unrelated to the Get of Fenris directly, and is instead a group of Garou from all tribes that have decided to go full ecofascist in the face of Apocalypse, and do as you said and just ignore all the white supremacist implications all together. Change the name, even so the tie is completely cut. You did move towards this, but just going all the way with it would go a long way to removing the baggage, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I stand corrected.<br /> <br /> Thanks.<br /> <br /> But my basic interpretation of this is that I think any discussion of the Cult of Fenris needs to not take into account Karim's desire to make a strike against white supremacy. Whenever it comes up, it basically just has to be regulated to the cut footage from the Snyder Cut. It doesn't matter what he had planned, it didn't make it to the final book. He may have wanted the Get to fall, specificallly, because of his issues with Nordic fascism but Werewolf: The Apocalypse's central theme from a storytelling standpoint<b> needed </b>a tribe to fall.<br /> <br /> W5 is many things but it's not confused about what sort of game it wants to be. It talks extensively about how the Old Way of Doing ThingsTM was wrong. So, they needed a tribe of the Garou to go reactionary conservative and become bad guys. Not fall to the Wyrm because the whole point is that they're fundamentalist Knights Templar equivalents, not Satan worshipers. A lesser man would *cough* and say, &quot;Pure&quot; from Werewolf: The Forsaken before *cough* again.<br /> <br /> The Pure being something that predates Karim's ideas about the Swords of Heimdall significantly. I'm not saying they always planned to have a tribe fill the Forsaken role but given how heavily Chronicles of Darkness has been mined, I wouldn't DISAGREE with that suggestion either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T07:50:14-08:00","id":1529427,"title":"","content":"Something interesting to note is that podcast also revealed that the original proposal for the fallen tribe would have been the Silver Fangs.<br /> <br /> And like. Wouldn't that have been so much more interesting? You want to depict the failings of the Garou? Can hardly do better than a decrepit monarchy that props itself up at the expense of the mission.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T07:56:07-08:00","id":1529428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gh0st-fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529427#post1529427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something interesting to note is that podcast also revealed that the original proposal for the fallen tribe would have been the Silver Fangs.<br /> <br /> And like. Wouldn't that have been so much more interesting? You want to depict the failings of the Garou? Can hardly do better than a decrepit monarchy that props itself up at the expense of the mission.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, I don't know, what is the reason that people REALLY HATE the Get as a choice?<br /> <br /> Versus any other tribe?<br /> <br /> I mean the Get certainly are a tribe people CARED about falling. If the Red Talons fell, would anyone have complained? Would anyone have cared? Would it have been a tragedy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T08:15:12-08:00","id":1529429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529428#post1529428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, I don't know, what is the reason that people REALLY HATE the Get as a choice?<br /> <br /> Versus any other tribe?<br /> <br /> I mean the Get certainly are a tribe people CARED about falling. If the Red Talons fell, would anyone have complained? Would anyone have cared? Would it have been a tragedy?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's fairly simple, actually - the tribe was written as taking action to address a major issue that they had within their tribe. They were an example of how to handle a problem that had stood for some time before W20 was a possibility, and then some Vampire main who hadn't read W:tA books released after 1993 came in and ruined it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T08:17:55-08:00","id":1529430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529429#post1529429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's fairly simple, actually - the tribe was written as taking action to address a major issue that they had within their tribe. They were an example of how to handle a problem that had stood for some time before W20 was a possibility, and then some Vampire main who hadn't read W:tA books released after 1993 came in and ruined it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah but...none of that is in the book.<br /> <br /> The racism isn't why the tribe fell and it's barely even alluded to. So I don't get it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T08:30:10-08:00","id":1529431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529428#post1529428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, I don't know, what is the reason that people REALLY HATE the Get as a choice?<br /> <br /> Versus any other tribe?<br /> <br /> I mean the Get certainly are a tribe people CARED about falling. If the Red Talons fell, would anyone have complained? Would anyone have cared? Would it have been a tragedy?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because the only reason the Get were chosen was because of this. You can't separate it from that no matter how much you insist we should. Historically the Get were the only ones that actually cleaned house on their own problems. Why turn around and undo that if it doesn't matter?<br /> <br /> And no, I don't think they would have. I wouldn't want the Red Talons to fall either, personally, but they do represent a much more blatant failing of the Garou within the game's own terms. Blatant ecofascism, brutality towards humans, holding into grudges and promoting infighting over protecting Gaia,etc. Same with the Silver Fangs, with propping up corrupt elders and their own superiority over protecting Gaia.<br /> <br /> These tribes much, much better cover the actual flaws of the Garou and their society on the game's own terms. Making it the Get implies that their biggest failing is that they cared too much about fighting the Wyrm, which dilutes the point of WtA.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28155-gh0st-fox","name":"gh0st-fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28155_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T08:40:47-08:00","id":1529433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529430#post1529430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah but...none of that is in the book.<br /> <br /> The racism isn't why the tribe fell and it's barely even alluded to. So I don't get it.</div> </div> </div> </div>We just spent threads detailing how Hauglosk is absolutely &quot;You turn into the Swords of Heimdall, basically,&quot; and you're still pulling this shit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T08:53:46-08:00","id":1529435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529433#post1529433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We just spent threads detailing how Hauglosk is absolutely &quot;You turn into the Swords of Heimdall, basically,&quot; and you're still pulling this shit?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean it's not true.<br /> <br /> All people could point to was calling the Cult fascists, which they absolutely are in a book about how no Tribe has any cultural ties. Are we assuming the Cult of Fenris in rural China are white supremacists?<br /> <br /> SOME Get are white supremacists but I think we pretty conclusively proved that the pushback against Karim's desire succeeded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T08:56:08-08:00","id":1529436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gh0st-fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529431#post1529431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because the only reason the Get were chosen was because of this. You can't separate it from that no matter how much you insist we should. Historically the Get were the only ones that actually cleaned house on their own problems. Why turn around and undo that if it doesn't matter?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because their problem isn't white supremacy.<br /> <br /> Their problem is they're murdering indiscriminately and committing terrorism as well as being part of a suicidal death cult. The Get got rid of the Swords of Heimdall, eliminated their racist faction, and moved on.<br /> <br /> They fell because the rest of the Garou wouldn't attack Malfeas.<br /> <br /> That's what's in the book.<br /> <br /> The whole book is about how the Garou aren't tied to specific cultures anymore. There's black, white, and other Garou in every tribe. Including the Cult. Some Garou may be racist but that's not the reason the Get fell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T09:08:48-08:00","id":1529437,"title":"","content":"The book hates the Cult of Fenris.<br /> <br /> They call them fascists, they call them Nazis, they call them eco fascists and terrorists. They say that they're suffering from Hauglosk and scum. The Ahourn has symbols that are blatantly racist tattoos. BUT they made it so it wasn't a white supremacist takeover because, well, that makes no goddamn sense if the Cult of Fenris aren't white. Which they aren't because almost all of the changes of the book about how the tribes are global now. Not that racism has to make sense. It absolutely doesn't.<br /> <br /> But the Cult of Fenris has a motivation for falling and it was their desire for attacking the Wyrm as one and feeling the Garou aren't doing enough to save Gaia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T09:20:51-08:00","id":1529439,"title":"","content":"Red Talons and Silver Fangs had an in-universe reason to fall. Both are fun tribes but they have massive flaws. And people already hate the Talons.<br /> <br /> Get of Fenris? Not only are they a popular tribe, but the reason they were made into CoF was not out of anything in-universe. It was because Muammar wanted them as the bad guys because they were a Nordic tribe. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1523730#post1523730\">From what Sambrano has posted</a>, that was the crux of the matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T09:25:29-08:00","id":1529440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529428#post1529428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, I don't know, what is the reason that people REALLY HATE the Get as a choice?<br /> <br /> Versus any other tribe?<br /> <br /> I mean the Get certainly are a tribe people CARED about falling. If the Red Talons fell, would anyone have complained? Would anyone have cared? Would it have been a tragedy?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't like the Get of Fenris becoming unplayable. I think that I would be unhappy about that regardless of how it was done. I don't necessarily accept that idea that any Tribe has to fall, because even for Tribes that I don't like as much, I can understand how fans of that Tribe would be upset if they became unplayable villains.<br /> <br /> Speaking of some necessity for a Tribe to fall - what does it even mean for a Tribe to &quot;fall&quot;? When I think of a Tribe falling, I think that either the Tribe falls to the Wyrm or it is destroyed. Neither happened to the Get of Fenris. If I heard that in an upcoming Star Wars movie that Rey &quot;falls&quot; I would think that she goes to the Dark Side. That is what falling means in Star Wars. In W:tA falling means going to the Wyrm, not just becoming a meanie.<br /> <br /> In addition to not liking the GoF becoming unplayable (which I wouldn't like for other Tribes either or would at least sympathize) I am particularly unhappy with how the &quot;fall&quot; of the Get was handled. If the Wyrm is rising in power and the GoF lead a ferocious battle against the Wyrm and prevent the Apocalypse but are mostly destroyed or corrupted, then I would like that a lot more and it would be thematically appropriate for the Tribe.<br /> <br /> That isn't what they did. They made all of the Get of Fenris into Swords of Heimdall to satisfy the whims of an author who wanted to make a political statement. Quite frankly, that pisses me off and I think it would piss me off if something similar was done with another Tribe. Before anybody replies and says that that didn't happen - no, it basically did happen. The reason the GoF &quot;fall&quot; is that they became Nazis and then the serial numbers were filed off of that plan and they were turned into generic extremists who, just coincidentally, still happen to often be Nazis.<br /> <br /> I don't even think that what happened to them even constitutes falling. So the GoF become bigger assholes, does that mean that they are now unplayable villains? No, that doesn't make any sense. They became unplayable villains because the plan was for them to be Nazis which the authors see as unplayable villains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":5},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T09:49:36-08:00","id":1529441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529428#post1529428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, I don't know, what is the reason that people REALLY HATE the Get as a choice?<br /> <br /> Versus any other tribe?<br /> <br /> I mean the Get certainly are a tribe people CARED about falling. If the Red Talons fell, would anyone have complained? Would anyone have cared? Would it have been a tragedy?</div> </div> </div> </div>To be quite honest, I don't think so. The Red Talons are already pretty extreme, most of them anyway. I believe that if it were the Red Talons, the Silver Fangs or Little Brother there would be no complaints or it would be much less than now at least (my vote would be for the last one by the way), if it were not just the GoF, but the CoG, Shadow Lords, Black Furies, Glass Walkers and MAYBE the Fianna would also cause revolt, the rest of the tribes I'm not so sure about the reaction. Basically I think it's more because of the concept of the tribe itself that seems to please more people, whether its real concept or its shallower version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T10:28:50-08:00","id":1529442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529423#post1529423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My interpretation is that there's an element that gets glossed over when discussing his article or actually several articles that should be kept in mind.<br /> <br /> 1. <b>Sambrano actually doesn't care about the Get</b>: When he speaks about it with Karim, he's talking about it as a fan. It's not related to his primary issues with the developers and just thought it was a bad idea. Karim really wanted to make a bunch of white supremacist villains to kill because he really fucking hates Nazis. That's not...a bad thing. Sambrano, again as a W:TA fan, just felt making the Get was a bad thing. He also confirms that everyone forced him not to do it.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>His primary complaint is about the decoupling of the Garou from individual cultural identity</b>: Which is something that was the entire theme of the game's re-imagining.<br /> <br /> 3. <b>His biggest complaint is lack of attribution</b>: Which is actually 100% accurate and he should be listed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been trying to remain committed to staying out of these conversations for reasons which I hope will be clarified below, but as you can imagine, sometimes people draw my attention to specific items, and this one (and some previous statements you have made about what I have said or what my intentions were) and this one is so egregious, I have temporarily changed my stance to come here and ask you to please stop intentionally misrepresenting or unintentionally misreading what I had to say about my horrific experience working for Paradox Entertainment was like. You are using a letter which I wrote to talk about how absolutely terrible it is in this industry to endure racism and anti-Indigenous attitudes from the people who hold the power while they try to use your name to say that they are actually the good guys.<br /> <br /> As Werewolf 5th Edition put it: #NotAllCorporations<br /> <br /> Anyway, literally all three of these points are incorrect, and not just incorrect because I haven't said anything about it, but incorrect and flying directly in the face of what I have said. So let's go over this publicly in the hopes that you adjust your stance and stop using my experience to win fights in this forum.<br /> <br /> 1. I do not care about the Fenrir as a fan. If you are really invested in my personal feelings on the Fenrir, that discussion can be had in a more casual environment on another day. I wasn't working on that book as a fan, I was contracted as an author and developer. I am a fan, but my concern about the complete Nazification of the Fenrir that Karim was insisting on was that he was unintentionally going to create harm in the community by glorifying Nazi beliefs and practices. I understand that arguments against this, and it's fine to have differing opinions on it, but that was mine. An example of where I think harm was created historically in Werewolf and then was adjusted in the correct way was how in editions 1st through Revised, Black Spiral Dancers were explicitly written as rapists, and in the BNS edition, this was entirely removed. Even on a villain faction, that created harm for people, and needed to be removed.<br /> <br /> 2. Absolutely false. I made this clear multiple times. The version we worked on did not decouple ethnicity from the Tribes, although it was downplayed. That said, I had explicit instructions to write the Ghost Council as an Indigenous tribe--and as you can see the Fenrir were [and are] still Norse. <br /> <br /> 3. The absolute least of concerns is my personal attribution on this book. I said very clearly in what I wrote, and on many occasions in public that I do not want to be attributed in this book. I think this book was not only written poorly, but also has created a lot of harm, and done exactly what I warned about while I was working on it. I never want to work for Paradox Entertainment again, and I do not want any association with them or their products. Perhaps you are misconstruing something I said that &quot;I was curious to see&quot;--which is not remotely &quot;my biggest complaint&quot;--which was whether or not I would be credited. The reason that had my curiosity was because I thought it would tell me a lot more about the ethics of the company. And it did. It told all of us about their ethics.<br /> <br /> I won't be replying to this again, but please stop doing exactly what I said was the problem with Paradox and Muammar in the first place: using the work of an Indigenous creator while spitting on their actual perspectives and experiences to give yourself credit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":6},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6},{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28127-j-f-sambrano","name":"j.f. sambrano","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28127_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T10:30:16-08:00","id":1529443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529440#post1529440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In addition to not liking the GoF becoming unplayable (which I wouldn't like for other Tribes either or would at least sympathize) I am particularly unhappy with how the &quot;fall&quot; of the Get was handled. If the Wyrm is rising in power and the GoF lead a ferocious battle against the Wyrm and prevent the Apocalypse but are mostly destroyed or corrupted, then I would like that a lot more and it would be thematically appropriate for the Tribe.<br /> <br /> That isn't what they did. They made all of the Get of Fenris into Swords of Heimdall to satisfy the whims of an author who wanted to make a political statement. Quite frankly, that pisses me off and I think it would piss me off if something similar was done with another Tribe. Before anybody replies and says that that didn't happen - no, it basically did happen. The reason the GoF &quot;fall&quot; is that they became Nazis and then the serial numbers were filed off of that plan and they were turned into generic extremists who, just coincidentally, still happen to often be Nazis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Worse is that they made Red Talons WORSE from before and STILL you can play them.<br /> <br /> The CoF are unplayable because the Brand Designer, to quote directly from him, <i>&quot;Would argue cutting them entirely, if the writers are unwilling to tackle their unsavory history, as framing them as 'noble Nordic warriors' reeks of neo-fascism far more than acknowledging those traits as villanous.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> This was not a choice made out of consideration which tribe would be missed the least like the Pure in Forsaken were. This choice was made ENTIRELY because one guy saw noble nordic warriors as automaticly neo-fascistic.<br /> <br /> This also means that a tribe that -historically- has been banned from most games and that gets stereotyped as human killing nutcases, is taking valuable page space from a tribe that isn't going to be banned as a default. As much as I like the Talons, they just aren't liked enough to justify their existence in W5 while the Fenrir who are one of the most popular tribes get cut.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T11:05:09-08:00","id":1529444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>j.f. sambrano</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-te