and it's fine to have differing opinions on it, but that was mine. An example of where I think harm was created historically in Werewolf and then was adjusted in the correct way was how in editions 1st through Revised, Black Spiral Dancers were explicitly written as rapists, and in the BNS edition, this was entirely removed. Even on a villain faction, that created harm for people, and needed to be removed.<br /> <br /> 2. Absolutely false. I made this clear multiple times. The version we worked on did not decouple ethnicity from the Tribes, although it was downplayed. That said, I had explicit instructions to write the Ghost Council as an Indigenous tribe--and as you can see the Fenrir were [and are] still Norse.<br /> <br /> 3. The absolute least of concerns is my personal attribution on this book. I said very clearly in what I wrote, and on many occasions in public that I do not want to be attributed in this book. I think this book was not only written poorly, but also has created a lot of harm, and done exactly what I warned about while I was working on it. I never want to work for Paradox Entertainment again, and I do not want any association with them or their products. Perhaps you are misconstruing something I said that &quot;I was curious to see&quot;--which is not remotely &quot;my biggest complaint&quot;--which was whether or not I would be credited. The reason that had my curiosity was because I thought it would tell me a lot more about the ethics of the company. And it did. It told all of us about their ethics.<br /> <br /> I won't be replying to this again, but please stop doing exactly what I said was the problem with Paradox and Muammar in the first place: using the work of an Indigenous creator while spitting on their actual perspectives and experiences to give yourself credit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the response and clarification. Much appreciated!<br /> <br /> It sets the record straight and I appreciate you sharing all of the information you did.<br /> <br /> No offense was intended in the slightest or misattribution.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T11:43:05-08:00","id":1529445,"title":"","content":"What about giving Parawolf both middle fingers and actually playing as the Cult of Fenrir?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T11:57:30-08:00","id":1529446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1528721-ten-tips-to-running-the-cult-of-fenris-in-werewolf-fifth-edition?p=1529445#post1529445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about giving Parawolf both middle fingers and actually playing as the Cult of Fenrir?</div> </div> </div> </div>See what Sambrano said on the previous page, it would basically be like playing nazis. Even if the numbers are filed off, that was the core concept Muammar pushed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://